      "en": "and the rest grabbed his servants, treated them shamefully, and killed them.",
      "ko": "그 남은 자들은 종들을 잡아 능욕하고 죽이니",
      "source_text_hash": "b9baaba2628a483560c1dfd333d0f6474d437fed5fd0951758002805bfbbf145",
      "translation_text_hash": "8569241479442f35f36cc7f6264d92414e0aaa5b58a8e58d5f0b448307e48f5c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 남은 자들은 종들을 잡아 능욕하고 죽이니"
