        {
          "book": "MAT",
          "chapter": 22,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "When the king heard that, he was angry, and sent his armies, destroyed those murderers, and burned their city.",
      "ko": "임금이 노하여 군대를 보내어 그 살인한 자들을 진멸하고 그 동네를 불사르고",
      "source_text_hash": "5f6baf576988a97d80c38b2d62960b6a9bd108acedde1eb96f146bdf355f0386",
      "translation_text_hash": "a157ee3aff0be46143d641c8ae9a4fe95523c1bdbaf56eda92aaf4b3885708c5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "임금이 노하여 군대를 보내어 그 살인한 자들을 진멸하고 그 동네를 불사르고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "a157ee3aff0be46143d641c8ae9a4fe95523c1bdbaf56eda92aaf4b3885708c5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:MAT:22:8",
      "sequence": 23881,
