      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "MAT",
          "chapter": 22,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "“Then he said to his servants, ‘The wedding is ready, but those who were invited weren’t worthy.",
      "ko": "이에 종들에게 이르되 혼인 잔치는 예비되었으나 청한 사람들은 합당치 아니하니",
      "source_text_hash": "a54227721ebc83be58a306b70411c1ff211cae9e1f3c7095fa674fcba984280c",
      "translation_text_hash": "1a2caa4685a1ec7b3355baafb4b8fa34ddaa709959d20ae3b31909173fda45db",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이에 종들에게 이르되 혼인 잔치는 예비되었으나 청한 사람들은 합당치 아니하니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "1a2caa4685a1ec7b3355baafb4b8fa34ddaa709959d20ae3b31909173fda45db"
      ]
    },
    {
