      "en": "Those servants went out into the highways and gathered together as many as they found, both bad and good. The wedding was filled with guests.",
      "ko": "종들이 길에 나가 악한 자나 선한 자나 만나는 대로 모두 데려오니 혼인자리에 손이 가득한지라",
      "source_text_hash": "c3352b86d743ee472d6c077338e2ee35bce9f912a79a450cce931f64ce1cbb14",
      "translation_text_hash": "c0543deee29c8dcb30d90b4a19075e2ac71892ecf5b46a3adf37db68cf657ea2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
