        "verse": 12
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "MAT",
          "chapter": 22,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "and he said to him, ‘Friend, how did you come in here not wearing wedding clothing?’ He was speechless.",
      "ko": "가로되 친구여 어찌하여 예복을 입지 않고 여기 들어왔느냐 하니 저가 유구무언이어늘",
      "source_text_hash": "e5460171913f94b450604b1bc2724e36d1bcf74aeca9e8de4a98ee98f6f78b42",
      "translation_text_hash": "7ed310c810789931e75d65a7c911538e988bed16b125b6a10cc33f2d762c31ce",
