      "en": "Then the king said to the servants, ‘Bind him hand and foot, take him away, and throw him into the outer darkness. That is where the weeping and grinding of teeth will be.’",
      "ko": "임금이 사환들에게 말하되 그 수족을 결박하여 바깥 어두움에 내어 던지라 거기서 슬피 울며 이를 갊이 있으리라 하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "8f7b43bc29ae11702ac663c6b322df67990c2b5bb21613738296c4566c2d3620",
      "translation_text_hash": "4ec08510e00f93c1d67deb973321ebd9c2c0ae31729cbe9cc7d44e7f66ef2afc",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
